ts/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"The webhook config points to files (`ca_cert_file`, `mtls_options.cert_file`, `mtls_options.key_file`). For mTLS, enter the PEM as `cert_content` and `key_content`; remove any other file field, including `ca_cert_file`, which has no inline equivalent (the receiver certificate must chain to the system trust store). See the upgrade note in DMS."},"1137":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"400 `struct validation error` creating or updating a DMS"},"1138":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"The webhook config of the operation that uses it is invalid. Review `external_webhook_settings` in DMS."},"1139":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"HTTP 500 with an `err` body on enroll or reenroll"},"1140":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"Service failures rea