"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/overview-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/overview#choose-your-path","content":"Access control"},"1585":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/overview-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/overview#choose-your-path","content":"A CA determines who signs, and a profile defines what can be issued. The DMS applies admission and enrollment policy. The device retains its association with certificates, and the external consumer decides which identity it accepts."},"1586":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/overview-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/overview#architecture-at-a-glance","content":"An identity's journey connects four responsibilities:"},"1587":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/overview-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/overview#architecture-at-a-glance","content":"The PKI administrator prepares the authority, its key and issuance rules."},"1588":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/overview-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/overview#architecture-at-a-glance","content":"The provisioning administrator configures the DMS and initial trust."},"1589":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/overview-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/overview#architecture-at-a-glance","content":"The device client requests a certificate and installs it with the matching key."},"1590":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/overview-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/