ates a root that issues directly; to design an operational hierarchy, see Hierarchy and rotation."},"2232":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#open-the-creation-wizard","content":"In **Certification Authorities**, select **Create New CA** and choose to create a CA with a new key pair."},"2233":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#open-the-creation-wizard","content":"The &#x2A;*Create New CA (Existing Key)** flow is explained in the authorities guide."},"2234":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#select-the-key","content":"Choose the engine that will keep the key and an algorithm its capabilities allow. For this example, you can use **EC P-384** if available."},"2235":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#select-the-key","content":"The CA private key is used through the engine. In this path, you will download only the authority's public certificate."},"2236":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-the-authority","content":"Select **Root CA** and complete:"},"2237":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-the-authority","content":"**CA Name**: `Acme Evaluation Root CA`."},"2238":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-the-authority","content":"**Subject**: organization and country details for your evaluation."},"2239":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-the-authority","content":"**CA Certificate Expiration**: for example, one year from creation."},"2240":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-the-authority","content":"**Default End-Entity Certificate Issuance Expiration**: for example, 90 days, within the CA's lifetime."},"2241":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"typ