:"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/troubleshooting-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/troubleshooting#issuance-fails","content":"Correct PEM and verifiable signature."},"2353":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/troubleshooting-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/troubleshooting#issuance-fails","content":"`openssl req -in request.csr -noout -verify -text`."},"2354":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/troubleshooting-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/troubleshooting#issuance-fails","content":"Profile"},"2355":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/troubleshooting-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/troubleshooting#issuance-fails","content":"Selected source, existing ID, allowed algorithm and size."},"2356":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/troubleshooting-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/troubleshooting#issuance-fails","content":"Check Profiles precedence; CA and DMS resolve differently."},"2357":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/troubleshooting-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/troubleshooting#issuance-fails","content":"Result"},"2358":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/troubleshooting-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/troubleshooting#issuance-fails","content":"Appropriate subject, SAN, usages and dates."},"2359":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/troubleshooting-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/troubleshooting#issuance-fails","content":"Compare CSR, profile and certificate; successful issuance does not establish consumer acceptance."},"2360":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/troubleshooting-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/troubleshooting#issuance-fails","content":"For unexpected certificate fields, review `Honor Subject`, `Honor Key Usage`, `Honor Extended Key Usages` and `Honor Extensions`. The latter preserves SAN only, without validating entitlement to those names. Validity is not automatically clamped to CA expiration."},"2361":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/troubleshooting-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/troubleshooting#issuance-fails","content":"For CA reissuance failures, check revocation and date: reissuance is not supported for a revoked or already expired CA. To change its key, use Hierarchy and rotation."},"2362":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/troubleshooting-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/troubleshooting#ocsp-or-crl-do-not-reflect-a-change","content":"Check each boundary independently:"},"2363":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/troubleshooting-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/troubleshooting#ocsp-or-crl-do-not-reflect-a-change","content":"**Record:** read the correct certificate again by serial and issuer. Confirm status, reason and time; expired or permanently revoked records reject further transitions."},"2364":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/troubleshooting-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/troubleshooting#ocsp-or-crl-do-not-reflect-a-change","content":"**Endpoint:** inspect AIA and CDP. Query those URLs from the consumer’s network; an old route or incorrect issuer can explain a discrepancy."},"2365":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/troubleshooting-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/troubleshooting#ocsp-or-crl-do-not-reflect-a-change","content":"**OCSP:** save a fresh response, verify signature and timestamps, and observe status. An HTTP error for an absent serial does not mean `Good` or guarantee a signed `Unknown`."},"2366":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/troubleshooting-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/troubleshooting#ocsp-or-crl-do-not-reflect-a-change","content":"**CRL:** compare `latest_crl`, number and timestamps with the downloaded list. Check the serial in its contents. If unchanged, review `regenerate_on_revoke`, event delivery, jobs, signing and storage with the deployment operator."},"2367":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/troubleshooting-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/troubleshooting#ocsp-or-crl-do-not-reflect-a-change","content":"**Client:** check cache, policy for expired or unavailable evidence, critical IDP extension and rejection of a new connection."},"2368":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/troubleshooting-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/platform/pki/troubleshooting#ocsp-or-crl-do-not-reflect-a-change","content":"Reactivation 