nes para producción"},"199":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#instala-lamassu-con-helm","content":"Usa Helm cuando necesites control explícito sobre identidad, bases de datos, mensajería, certificados, almacenamiento y upgrades. Para un entorno de evaluación en el que el script pueda tomar esas decisiones, usa Fastlane."},"200":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"Prepara los servicios de plataforma que quedan deliberadamente fuera del chart de Lamassu:"},"201":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"un clúster Kubernetes 1.24+ y Helm 3.2+"},"202":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"un servidor PostgreSQL accesible y un rol autorizado para crear bases de datos y schemas"},"203":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"un broker RabbitMQ accesible y sus credenciales"},"204":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"un proveedor OIDC, normalmente Keycloak, con un realm/tenant y un cliente para Lamassu"},"205":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"Envoy Gateway 1.8+ y una `GatewayClass`"},"206":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"cert-manager 1.14+; para TLS de confianza, un emisor de confianza o un Secret TLS de Kubernetes"},"207":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"una StorageClass y un diseño de tráfico externo"},"208":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"El chart usa por defecto una `GatewayClass` llamada `eg`. Cambia `gateway.className` si tu equipo de plataforma utiliza otro nombre."},"209":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"Tú proporcionas el servidor PostgreSQL. El job de pre-install del chart se conecta con las credenciales indicadas, crea las bases de datos `pki`, `authz` y `wfx` y los schemas de los servicios, ejecuta las migraciones y aplica `services.authz.bootstrap`."},"210":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"El chart no tiene dependencias Helm que instalen PostgreSQL, RabbitMQ, un proveedor OIDC, Envoy Gateway ni cert-manager."},"211":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#1-instala-los-requisitos-del-gateway","content":"Instala o actualiza las CRD de Envoy Gateway antes de su controlador. Estos comandos usan la misma versión que el repositorio Helm de Lamassu:"},"212":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#1-instala-los-requisitos-del-gateway","content":"Crea la `GatewayClass` predeterminada si todavía no existe. Guarda este manifiesto como `gateway-class.yaml`:"},"213":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#1-instala-los-requisitos-del-gateway","content":"Instala cert-manager por separado antes de Lamassu. El chart actual renderiza sus recursos de issuer self-signed y certificado CA incluso cuando `tls.type: external` hace que el Gateway use un Secret TLS existente. Seleccionar TLS externo no elimina por tanto el requisito de cert-manager."},"214":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#2-crea-un-archivo-de-valores","content":"Parte de los valores predeterminados del chart y sobrescribe los específicos del entorno. Este ejemplo supone que PostgreSQL, RabbitMQ y Keycloak son accesibles mediante DNS de Kubernetes y expone Keycloak en `/auth` a través del Gateway compartido:"},"215":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#2-crea-un-archivo-de-valores","content":"No añadas `gateway.addresses` por defecto. Deja la asignación de dirección a la implementación del balanceador salvo que tu diseño de red requiera una VIP concreta en Kubernetes. La IP pública de un NAT o proxy upstream no corresponde a este valor."},"216":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#2-crea-un-archivo-de-valores","content":"Si Keycloak es externo y ya tiene una URL accesible, apunta la configuración OIDC hacia él y omite la entrada `/auth` de `gateway.extraRouting`."},"217":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#tls-con-un-secret-existente","content":"Crea un Secret con `tls.crt` y `tls.key` y referéncialo:"},"218":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#provisiona-el-primer-administrador","content":"No existe un superusuario implícito. Crea en el proveedor OIDC el rol o grupo esperado por `services.authz.bootstrap` y asígnalo al menos a un administrador antes de exponer Lamassu."},"219":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#provisiona-el-primer-administrador","content":"El job de pre-install y pre-upgrade aplica el bootstrap de forma idempotente: conserva los principales existentes y añade los grants que falten."},"220":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#provisiona-el-primer-administrador","content":"Prueba una identidad autorizada y otra denegada. Si ningún token coincide con un principal activo del bootstrap, nadie podrá administrar la PKI."},"221":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#provisiona-el-primer-administrador","content":"Consulta Control de acceso para conocer el modelo de principales y políticas."},"222":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#3-instala-lamassu","content":"Para instalar un checkout local:"},"223":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-35","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#4-verifica-el-despliegue","content":"El Gateway debe mostrar `PROGRAMMED=True`. Si está programado pero no tiene una dirección utilizable, continúa con Expón el Gateway."},"224":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-36","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#4-verifica-el-despliegue","content":"El test de Helm comprueba los endpoints de salud de CA, DMS Manager, Device Manager y VA, y verifica la respuesta de la UI."},"225":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-37","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#actualiza-lamassu","content":"Los pasos de upgrade específicos de cada versión se mantienen en `charts/lamassu/CHANGELOG/` dentro del repositorio Helm. El chart también incluye un job de pre-upgrade opcional que migra las claves privadas de CA existentes al motor KMS configurado para el release. Está desactivado por defecto (`migrations.caToKms.enabled: false`) y solo es necesario cuando actualizas desde una versión anterior a 3.7.0."},"226":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-38","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#actualiza-lamassu","content":"Mientras el flag esté activo, cada `helm upgrade` crea el job `<chart fullname>-ca-to-kms-migration` (`lamassu-ca-to-kms-migration` para el release `lamassu`); una instalación nueva no lo crea. Se ejecuta antes del resto de hooks de pre-upgrade, la configuración de bootstrap de autorización y el job de migración de base de datos, que usan hook weights `-4` y `-3` frente a su `-10`."},"227":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-39","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#actualiza-lamassu","content":"El job consume la misma configuración del servicio KMS que el chart renderiza en el ConfigMap de KMS, incluidos los motores de `services.kms.cryptoEngines`, y ejecuta la imagen de la herramienta de migración definida en `migrations.caToKms.image`. La monta en modo read-only en `/etc/lamassuiot/config.yml` desde la clave `config` del ConfigMap, así que configura el motor de destino en tus valores antes del upgrade que realiza la migración."},"228":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-40","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#actualiza-lamassu","content":"El job resuelve su configuración mediante un volumen proyectado con dos fuentes opcionales: el ConfigMap `<chart fullname>-kms-config`, cuyo nombre incorpora el release (`lamassu-kms-config` para el release `lamassu`, `prod-lamassu-kms-config` para el release `prod`), y el ConfigMap legacy `kms-config`, sin el nombre del release, creado por versiones anteriores del chart. La configuración legacy mantiene la autoridad mientras siga presente y el job usa el ConfigMap del release una vez el legacy desaparece. Ambas fuentes son opcionales, por lo que un ConfigMap ausente nunca deja el pod del upgrade en `ContainerCreating`."},"229":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-41","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#actualiza-lamassu","content":"Mantén `migrations.caToKms.enabled: true` en el upgrade que realiza la migración y elimina después el flag de tus valores una vez completada la migración; su valor por defecto es `false`."},"230":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-42","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#decisiones-para-producción","content":"Antes de pasar a producción, revisa:"},"231":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-43","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#decisiones-para-producción","content":"backup y recuperación de PostgreSQL y volúmenes persistentes"},"232":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-44","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#decisiones-para-producción","content":"un motor KMS de producción; el motor filesystem predeterminado no ofrece alta disponibilidad"},"233":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-45","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#decisiones-para-producción","content":"almacenamiento compartido para VA antes de aumentar sus réplicas"},"234":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-46","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#decisiones-para-producción","content":"roles OIDC gestionados y eliminación de credenciales de evaluación"},"235":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-47","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#decisiones-para-producción","content":"un emisor TLS de confianza o un certificado gestionado externamente"},"236":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-48","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#decisiones-para-producción","content":"recursos, réplicas, autoscaling, disruption budgets y placement"},"237":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-49","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#decisiones-para-producción","content":"SMTP, observabilidad y entrega de alertas"},"238":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-50","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#decisiones-para-producción","content":"las notas de migración de `charts/lamassu/CHANGELOG/` antes de cada upgrade, incluido el hook opcional de migración CA-to-KMS descrito arriba"},"239":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-51","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#decisiones-para-producción","content":"La referencia completa de valores se mantiene en `charts/lamassu/VALUES.md` dentro del repositorio Helm."},"240":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","type":"page","content":"Expón el Gateway","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Despliegue","Kubernetes autogestionado"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking"},"241":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","content":"Elige cómo llegan los clientes a Lamassu, cuándo definir gateway.addresses y cómo diseñar varios Gateways."},"242":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#expón-el-gateway-de-lamassu","content":"Expón el Gateway de Lamassu"},"243":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#necesitas-gatewayaddresses","content":"¿Necesitas `gateway.addresses`?"},"244":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#diseño-recomendado-para-un-solo-nodo","content":"Diseño recomendado para un solo nodo"},"245":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#k3s","content":"K3s"},"246":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#bare-metal-con-metallb-o-kube-vip","content":"Bare metal con MetalLB o kube-vip"},"247":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#proxy-externo-nat-o-vpn","content":"Proxy externo, NAT o VPN"},"248":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"¿Qué ocurre si necesitas tres Gateways?"},"249":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#guía-de-decisión","content":"Guía de decisión"},"250":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#verifica-la-ruta-de-tráfico","content":"Verifica la ruta de tráfico"},"251":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#expón-el-gateway-de-lamassu","content":"El chart de Lamassu crea un Gateway compartido con listeners HTTP y HTTPS. Envoy Gateway crea normalmente un deployment de proxy dedicado y un Service `LoadBalancer`."},"252":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#expón-el-gateway-de-lamassu","content":"La accesibilidad externa depende de toda la ruta. Un recurso `Gateway` no configura por sí mismo el router, firewall, DNS, balanceador cloud ni NAT upstream."},"253":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#necesitas-gatewayaddresses","content":"Normalmente no. Si lo omites, el controlador del Gateway y la implementación del balanceador pueden asignar una dirección y publicarla en `Gateway.status.addresses` y en el estado del Service generado."},"254":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#necesitas-gatewayaddresses","content":"Defí