leets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","content":"La asignación modifica el inventario de Lamassu. La clave y el certificado se instalan por separado en el dispositivo; la conexión con un consumidor se comprueba en la integración de ese destino."},"1514":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#antes-de-empezar","content":"Una instancia accesible y permisos para administrar DMS, dispositivos y la asociación de certificados."},"1515":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#antes-de-empezar","content":"Una CA activa con clave disponible. Si todavía no existe, sigue Crea tu primera CA."},"1516":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#antes-de-empezar","content":"Un certificado final activo de esa CA cuyo `Common Name` sea exactamente `device-001`, con su clave privada. Sigue Emite y verifica un certificado para obtener y comprobar ambos."},"1517":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#antes-de-empezar","content":"El identificador `device-001` 