-preview/pr-45/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepara-el-dms","content":"Configura **Authentication Mode** como `CLIENT_CERTIFICATE` y añade en **Validation CAs** la CA cuyos certificados iniciales aceptarás. Para esta evaluación puede ser la misma CA. Mantén habilitada **Verify CSR Signature** y deshabilitada la generación de claves en servidor si no la vas a utilizar."},"1523":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepara-el-dms","content":"Revisa los ajustes de renovación y distribución de confianza con la guía DMS, guarda el servicio y anota su identificador."},"1524":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepara-el-dms","content":"Vuelve a abrir el DMS y confirma que la CA de enrolamiento es la prevista y que el servicio aparece en el inventario."},"1525":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepara-el-dms","content":"Estos ajustes preparan la política DMS. Los pasos siguientes realizan el alta y la asignación desde la consola; no envían una solicitud EST ni prueban la admisión por ese protocolo."},"1526":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#registra-el-dispositivo","content":"Abre **Managed Devices** y la acción de registro. Completa:"},"1527":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#registra-el-dispositivo","content":"**Device ID**: `device-001`."},"1528":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#registra-el-dispositivo","content":"**Registration Authority**: el DMS que acabas de preparar; la etiqueta identifica al servicio que cumple el rol de autoridad de registro."},"1529":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#registra-el-dispositivo","content":"**Icon** y **Tags**: clasificación opcional."},"1530":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#registra-el-dispositivo","content":"Confirma el registro."},"1531":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#comprueba-el-estado-inicial","content":"Abre el dispositivo. Debe aparecer en **No Identity** y mostrar el DMS propietario seleccionado."},"1532":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#comprueba-el-estado-inicial","content":"El registro crea la entrada de inventario; el certificado todavía debe asociarse."},"1533":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#asigna-una-identidad","content":"Selecciona **Assign Identity** y el certificado existente con `CN=device-001`. Comprueba su número de serie, emisor y vigencia frente al certificado que verificaste en PKI."},"1534":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#asigna-una-identidad","content":"Confirma la asociación. La alternativa **Issue New Instead** se explica en Dispositivos e identidades."},"1535":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#verifica-el-dispositivo","content":"Comprueba que tiene una identidad activa. En **Certificate History**, verifica el número de serie asociado; en **Device Event Timeline**, localiza el evento de asignación."},"1536":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-45/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-p